["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/startTime", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The point in time when an element or an action starts,\nbecomes applicable, or becomes valid.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
